      "description": "PureTrack makes it easy to let others follow you on your adventures, for fun and safety.\n\n- Perfect for hikers, trampers, pilots, adventurers, mountain climbers, cyclists, kayakers, sailors, and anyone going anywhere remote.\n- Track aircraft, paragliders, gliders, vehicles, boats, kayaks, bikes, dogs, cats, people, or anything you like!\n\nKey features:\n- Now supporting satellite data live tracking, direct from your mobile phone!*\n- Easily share your live location with your friends on any computer or device with a simple web link.\n- Add multiple trackers or aircraft that you fly. Switch between them easily. Handy if you're jumping between multiple aircraft, vehicles or sports often.\n- PureTrack works worldwide, anywhere you've got cellular signal.\n- See all your friends on the same map.\n- Merge cellular tracking from this app with SPOT and InReach satellite trackers, ADSB, FLARM and OGN tracking data, for the ultimate coverage anywhere you go adventuring.\n- View tracks of where you've been.\n- Location data is shown on the puretrack.io website.\n- Follow aircraft from around the world.\n\n*Satellite data requires iPhone 14 or later, and must be supported by your cellular carrier.",
